<Slide style={{width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei'}}><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8'}}></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>过程③：可行性不是假设出来的，是修出来的</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C9DCF7', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>03 第二阶段 · 过程</Text></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 88, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9}}><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F0F5FC', paddingLeft: 15, paddingRight: 15, paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, justifyContent: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>表型 = repair(decode(g))：DMDE 给出的原始指派不保证可行，修复链把它修到不动点。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, gap: 6}}><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 11, alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>①</Text><Box style={{width: 1040, gap: 3}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>联合收敛（≤6 轮不动点）</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>合并 _consolidate → 航程修复 _repair_range → 终点巢 _choose_end_nests 反复迭代。只有真正起飞的航次才让出原巢泊位；先选巢再剪枝会算出「虚名额」→ 落地期超卖。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 11, alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>②</Text><Box style={{width: 1040, gap: 3}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>覆盖装载（默认单趟）</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>默认 coverage_first=False：_complete_coverage 单趟「可达即执行」补进落在解外的可达任务，只补不删，物理不可达保持 y_j = 0，覆盖门禁仍是终态挂点。EDD 不动点 _load_coverage_fixed_point 仅在 coverage_first=True 对照档启用。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 11, alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>③</Text><Box style={{width: 1040, gap: 3}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>时序守恒（纯调序）</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>_reorder_for_deadlines 按时间窗重排段内先后，不改任务集合；同一条时序链在调度层是不可拆单元。调序会改变航程长度，所以后面必须再闸一次航程。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 11, alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>④</Text><Box style={{width: 1040, gap: 3}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>交付前复查与装配</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>航程闸 → 终点巢 → 航程闸 → 覆盖门禁（voluntary_skip 非法 / capacity_shortfall 允许）→ 装配 _assemble。容量竞争下终点巢未必最近，配巢会把原本可行的航次重新推过剩余航程。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 12, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>关键：_repair_range 移除超航程任务后当场改派（reflow，可达即执行），全部改派失败才记 y_j = 0 证明性暂缓。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>这段链既不占基因维度，也不出现在任何递推公式里——顺序调整、超时重排、增删任务全发生在这里，是第二阶段最容易讲糊的一环。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>动态滚动的多机巢多无人机协同任务分配 · 方法讲解</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>14 / 19</Text></Box></Slide>